{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb/Bb]In Bethany a [Bb]man lay [Eb]sick, the one the Lord held dear
The [Gm]sisters sent a message, Lord, [Eb]the one you love is ill
[Bb]But four days in the tomb had passed [Eb]before the Lord came near
And [Gm]Martha ran to meet him, while [Eb]Mary stayed home [Bb]still
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
